  "captions": [
    {"start": 0.145, "end": 1.616, "lines": ["I'll start with that. So…"]},
    {"start": 2.785, "end": 6.625, "lines": ["where we go and where we sit,","Dan kind of touched on there."]},
    {"start": 6.625, "end": 11.105, "lines": ["We have our own little singular console","up on the third floor in MCC right next"]},
    {"start": 11.105, "end": 15.425, "lines": ["to the landing support officers","as an extension of the Flight"]},
    {"start": 15.425, "end": 16.705, "lines": ["Operations Directorate."]},
    {"start": 16.705, "end": 21.785, "lines": ["But we're really here","as a representation of the organization,"]},
    {"start": 22.065, "end": 26.345, "lines": ["the DOD organization","that performs this mission set."]},
    {"start": 26.672, "end": 29.552, "lines": ["They, in turn,","have a support operations center,"]},
    {"start": 29.552, "end": 33.712, "lines": ["which is like a very scaled-down version","of Mission Control, not nearly as cool."]},
    {"start": 33.712, "end": 36.352, "lines": ["Far less displays","and fancy stuff to look at."]},
    {"start": 36.352, "end": 41.632, "lines": ["But that team will come onto a shift","where they're actually on console"]},
    {"start": 41.632, "end": 45.552, "lines": ["and preparing to support several hours","before the crew gets out there,"]},
    {"start": 45.552, "end": 48.67, "lines": ["several hours","before the fueling starts, for example,"]},
    {"start": 49.232, "end": 51.792, "lines": ["on a SpaceX mission."]},
    {"start": 51.792, "end": 52.952, "lines": ["And they are."]},
    {"start": 53.616, "end": 58.416, "lines": ["actually representing a another safety","capability in case something goes wrong"]},
    {"start": 58.416, "end": 59.456, "lines": ["on the pad, right?"]},
    {"start": 59.456, "end": 63.776, "lines": ["So if there's either a pad abort","or a pad egress scenario or some sort"]},
    {"start": 63.776, "end": 67.76, "lines": ["of explosion or whatever else may happen,"]},
    {"start": 67.76, "end": 71.28, "lines": ["The military has helicopters","right down the road at Patrick"]},
    {"start": 71.28, "end": 72.96, "lines": ["that they can lend a hand with."]},
    {"start": 72.96, "end": 75.36, "lines": ["So they'll spin up a couple hours"]},
    {"start": 75.36, "end": 79.84, "lines": ["before we do because those landing","support officers aren't really, you know,"]},
    {"start": 79.84, "end": 81.92, "lines": ["we come on call essentially when they do,"]},
    {"start": 81.92, "end": 85.7, "lines": ["and we'll show up and is like, hey,","the military's here, and we're here."]},
    {"start": 85.856, "end": 89.136, "lines": ["as an extension both","of the LSOs over to the DOD"]},
    {"start": 89.136, "end": 91.056, "lines": ["and as the DOD over to the LSOs."]},
    {"start": 91.056, "end": 94.016, "lines": ["And we'll sit uh on console,","we'll rotate out in the shift"]},
    {"start": 94.016, "end": 97.736, "lines": ["form just like any other flight","controller would um until uh"]},
    {"start": 98.176, "end": 102.4, "lines": ["for example on a on a dragon mission,","right, until Orbital insertion,"]},
    {"start": 102.4, "end": 105.76, "lines": ["and then is the military,","they don't all go to bed."]},
    {"start": 105.76, "end": 110.16, "lines": ["They still sit an alert capability","until the hatch opens. Oh, wow."]},
    {"start": 110.16, "end": 114.72, "lines": ["So the jet will still be fully loaded","and full of all the rescue gear just"]},
    {"start": 114.72, "end": 119.56, "lines": ["in case something were to go awry","with that docking process, or maybe"]},
    {"start": 119.92, "end": 122.88, "lines": ["something goes sideways","during the free flight phase."]},
    {"start": 122.88, "end": 127.648, "lines": ["The DOD is alerted for the entire time","until the hatch is open. And then we."]},
    {"start": 127.648, "end": 131.568, "lines": ["Kind of take a step back and go","into a different type of posture."]},
    {"start": 131.568, "end": 135.168, "lines": ["And where are those locations","that the rescue plan is staged?"]},
    {"start": 135.168, "end": 138.288, "lines": ["And where around the world","do you have people ready"]},
    {"start": 138.288, "end": 139.968, "lines": ["to jump into action? Good."]},
    {"start": 139.968, "end": 141.648, "lines": ["Yeah, that's a great question."]},
    {"start": 141.648, "end": 144.448, "lines": ["So touched","on the Support Operations Center first."]},
    {"start": 144.448, "end": 146.848, "lines": ["So that's done","at Patrick Space Force Base."]},
    {"start": 146.848, "end": 150.528, "lines": ["And there's about a dozen folks","who staff that."]},
    {"start": 150.528, "end": 152.048, "lines": ["There's a SOC director,"]},
    {"start": 152.048, "end": 156.928, "lines": ["there's a Medical doctor there who's","especially trained in space medicine."]},
    {"start": 156.928, "end": 162.608, "lines": ["There's experts in aircraft mission","planning, pararescue, and dive masters."]},
    {"start": 162.608, "end": 165.008, "lines": ["And so they all bring that expertise there"]},
    {"start": 165.008, "end": 169.488, "lines": ["during mission execution and training","leading up to the mission execution."]},
    {"start": 169.488, "end": 172.688, "lines": ["There's sometimes,","it depends on what option we get into,"]},
    {"start": 172.688, "end": 175.128, "lines": ["but there is a combination of Air Force"]},
    {"start": 175.488, "end": 181.248, "lines": ["helicopters, Navy helicopters,","and a Navy refueling ship that supports"]},
    {"start": 181.248, "end": 183.36, "lines": ["launch aborts out of the Cape."]},
    {"start": 183.36, "end": 188.24, "lines": ["And we also back that up with a C-17","and pararescue team out of Charleston."]},
    {"start": 188.24, "end": 191.28, "lines": ["And depending on the mission,","and if it's landing or launch,"]},
    {"start": 191.28, "end": 195.28, "lines": ["another C-17","with pararescumen out in Hawaii."]},
    {"start": 195.28, "end": 199.2, "lines": ["And then with each one of those aircraft,","there's a special rescue package"]},
    {"start": 199.2, "end": 204.72, "lines": ["that is full of specialized gear","and equipment that the teams will jump"]},
    {"start": 204.72, "end": 205.897, "lines": ["into the water with."]}
